(
    title: "Blades of Steel",
    developer: Some("Konami"),
    description: Some("Fast, rough ice hockey in three periods: you skate the puck-carrier in eight directions, pass with B and shoot with A at a moving target in front of the net, then switch to the nearest defender when possession turns over. Repeated checking sparks a fistfight in its own punching screen, ties go to a shootout, and a tournament of eight teams leads to the trophy. Two players can link up."),
